// markdownlint-cli2 configuration for this repository.
//
// This file records the documentation conventions the repository actually
// follows. It was added because running markdownlint-cli2 with its default
// configuration reported 22,710 findings, almost all of which were stylistic
// rules the project never enforced.
//
// Rule decisions (each one is backed by evidence, not by a wish for a green
// run):
//
//   MD013 (line-length) is disabled. The prose in this repository is not
//   hard-wrapped to a fixed column. Measured over the maintained docs, 8,507
//   lines exceed 88 characters, 975 exceed 120, 629 exceed 150, and the
//   longest is 1,358 characters (table rows and single-sentence paragraphs in
//   the audit reports). There is no column the documents agree on, so any
//   configured width would be arbitrary and enforcing it would re-wrap tens of
//   thousands of lines for no reader benefit.
//
//   MD024 (no-duplicate-heading) is enabled with siblings_only, not disabled.
//   The scenario template repeats section titles ("Diagnostic evidence",
//   "Ground-truth resolution", "References") once per scenario, each time
//   under a different parent. siblings_only is the documented setting for that
//   pattern: it permits the intended repeats while still catching a duplicate
//   heading introduced by mistake inside one section. The few genuine
//   sibling duplicates in the maintained audit and review reports were fixed
//   in those files, not excused by configuration.
//
// Everything else is left at the markdownlint default and fixed in the files.
//
// Ignores:
//   Frozen evaluation artifacts are excluded because they must stay
//   byte-for-byte identical to the run-3 manifest in
//   evaluation/results/run-3/artifact-hashes.json. Editing them to satisfy a
//   linter would invalidate the recorded hashes. See the accompanying report
//   for the findings that remain in these files as documented exceptions.
//   The archive is a point-in-time snapshot and the results directories are
//   historical run records; both are preserved as records rather than
//   formatted. research/official-documentation-index.md is generated by
//   research/build_doc_index.py and is linted through its generator instead.
{
  "config": {
    "MD013": false,
    "MD024": { "siblings_only": true }
  },
  "ignores": [
    ".agents/skills/**",
    "scenarios/**",
    "evaluation/packets/**",
    "archive/**",
    "evaluation/results/**",
    "research/official-documentation-index.md",
    "evaluation/rubric.md"
  ]
}
